00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:20.400
But I also believe, David, that I do believe
the Republican Party is a dying national party,

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:25.069
which might sound oxymoronic right now because
they'll probably take back the house next

00:08:25.069 --> 00:08:26.069
year.

00:08:26.069 --> 00:08:29.470
Yeah, but it's becoming a strong rural regional
party.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:31.970
I think it stays as a national party are dying.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:36.880
Speaker 1: Is there a national Republican
right now that you say that this is someone

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:41.000
