most Trump person you can be to win that nomination

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.360
Speaker 1: at this point.

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:19.570
On social issues for a for a while, the Republic,
the most conservative elements of the Republican

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:25.460
Party, including the Tea Party, made a big
deal out of We're against gay marriage, for

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:27.480
