00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:57.890
Speaker 4: Yeah, it's probably an advantage
because that's where their base is.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.200
I'd quibble with you on one thing, David.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:04.840
When it comes to the Tea Party and the base
of the Republican Party, I've always thought

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:07.370
